4, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 87, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/94/en_a1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_a1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 28.7, "size_bytes": 173088, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 87, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/94/en_a1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_a1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 24.475, "size_bytes": 147744, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 87, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/94/en_a1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_a1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 26.175, "size_bytes": 157968, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 87, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/94/en_a1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@315af5f/content/data/versions/931.json", "paragraphs": ["He Zuxun leads Shennong Group. He and Luo Wanyu ended their marriage. He gave her 78 million shares. These shares are worth about 2.48 billion yuan.", "The company now sells pigs at a loss. Shennong is cutting costs and stopping new building. It saved about 2 billion yuan in cash.", "He Zuxun's son He Xinyang works at the company. He is learning the business. But he does not own shares and is not on the board yet."], "paragraphs_zh": ["何祖训是神农集团的负责人。他和罗婉瑜结束了婚姻关系。他把7830万股分给了她。这些股份价值约24.8亿元。", "公司现在卖猪是亏钱的。神农正在削减成本，并停止新的建设。公司存下了约20亿元现金。", "何祖训的儿子何昕阳在公司工作。他正在学习业务。但他没有股份，也还没有进入董事会。"], "body": "He Zuxun leads Shennong Group. He and Luo Wanyu ended their marriage. He gave her 78 million shares. These shares are worth about 2.48 billion yuan.\n\nThe company now sells pigs at a loss. Shennong is cutting costs and stopping new building. It saved about 2 billion yuan in cash.\n\nHe Zuxun's son He Xinyang works at the company. He is learning the business. But he does not own shares and is not on the board yet.", "body_zh": "何祖训是神农集团的负责人。他和罗婉瑜结束了婚姻关系。他把7830万股分给了她。这些股份价值约24.8亿元。\n\n公司现在卖猪是亏钱的。神农正在削减成本，并停止新的建设。公司存下了约20亿元现金。\n\n何祖训的儿子何昕阳在公司工作。他正在学习业务。但他没有股份，也还没有进入董事会。", "text": "He Zuxun leads Shennong Group. He and Luo Wanyu ended their marriage. He gave her 78 million shares. These shares are worth about 2.48 billion yuan. The company now sells pigs at a loss. Shennong is cutting costs and stopping new building. It saved about 2 billion yuan in cash. He Zuxun's son He Xinyang works at the company. He is learning the business. But he does not own shares and is not on the board yet.", "vocab": [{"word": "shares", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股份", "note": "公司股票的一部分", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "company", "pos": "noun", "zh": "公司", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "pig", "pos": "noun", "zh": "猪", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "price", "pos": "noun", "zh": "价格", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "cash", "pos": "noun", "zh": "现金", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "cost", "pos": "noun", "zh": "成本", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "son", "pos": "noun", "zh": "儿子", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "board", "pos": "noun", "zh": "董事会", "note": "公司决策层", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-11T01:22:42.158123", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "He", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.425, "sm": 275, "em": 424, "cs": 0, "ce": 2, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Zuxun", "s": 0.425, "e": 0.9, "sm": 425, "em": 899, "cs": 3, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "leads", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.188, "sm": 900, "em": 1187, "cs": 9, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "Shennong", "s": 1.188, "e": 1.575, "sm": 1187, "em": 1574, "cs": 15, "ce": 23, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": 